-- ==================================================================
-- COCOON v3.6 — Continuous concurrent Hold/Place/Eject
-- - NON-STOP: repeats passes over all players+pets until button OFF
-- - 2 workers (game cap: 2 held objects)
-- - Movement-verified detach for pets (fixes stuck pets)
-- - Larger radius + re-hold attempts + parent/weld fallback
-- - Guaranteed eject on stop/error
-- - ORDER: every subject starts with sleep -> bath -> bored, then rest
-- - Players are processed before pets
-- ==================================================================
